<p><?=$cs_global?'Set default website permissions for all existing and future accounts. Account overrides take precedence.':'Choose which website actions the selected hosting account may use.'?> Administrators retain access to every action. Email permissions are managed separately in Email.</p>
<form id="cs-website-permissions" data-scope="<?=$cs_global?'server':'account'?>"><fieldset><legend>Allowed actions for <?=$escape($cs_global?'all accounts (global defaults)':$data['context']['owner'])?></legend>
